/blog/2026/08/thousands-of-people-in-china-have-had-banned-alzheimers-surgery</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 12:07:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/thousands-of-people-in-china-have-had-banned-alzheimers-surgery</guid></item><item><title>冰冰也许：在月球上寻找冰水的新方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ice-ice-maybe-new-ways-to-search-for-frozen-water-on-the-moon</link><description>科学家们使用模仿月球条件的独特真空室设计了一种利用地震波勘探冰的方法。这项工作可以帮助未来的阿尔忒弥斯任务找到水源。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ice-ice-maybe-new-ways-to-search-for-frozen-water-on-the-moon2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 11:52:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ice-ice-maybe-new-ways-to-search-for-frozen-water-on-the-moon</guid></item><item><title>使用超过 60 年的糖尿病药物被发现对大脑产生意外影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/diabetes-drug-used-for-more-than-60-years-found-to-unexpectedly-affect-the-brain</link><description>几十年来，一种药物一直是治疗 2 型糖尿病的主要药物&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/diabetes-drug-used-for-more-than-60-years-found-to-unexpectedly-affect-the-brain.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 06:09:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/diabetes-drug-used-for-more-than-60-years-found-to-unexpectedly-affect-the-brain</guid></item><item><title>染色体保护蛋白可能有助于解释肌肉修复和肌肉癌的罕见性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chromosome-protecting-protein-may-help-explain-muscle-repair-and-the-rarity-of-muscle-cancers</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chromosome-protecting-protein-may-help-explain-muscle-repair-and-the-rarity-of-muscle-cancers2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:54:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chromosome-protecting-protein-may-help-explain-muscle-repair-and-the-rarity-of-muscle-cancers</guid></item><item><title>摄入更少的蛋白质可以带来更大的健康益处并延长寿命</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/consuming-less-protein-could-have-greater-health-benefits-and-extend-lifespan</link><description>从麦片、咖啡到蛋白水，蛋白质强化食品随处可见。但一篇涵盖 350 多篇有关蛋白质限制和衰老论文的新评论于 7 月 31 日发表在《Cell Press》杂志上&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/consuming-less-protein-could-have-greater-health-benefits-and-extend-lifespan.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:39:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/consuming-less-protein-could-have-greater-health-benefits-and-extend-lifespan</guid></item><item><title>新发现的机制在细胞分裂过程中保护DNA</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/newly-discovered-mechanism-protects-dna-during-cell-division</link><description>每次细胞分裂时，它都必须在两个新细胞之间准确地复制和分配其 DNA。然而，在某些情况下，染色体不会完全分离，留下称为 DNA 桥的细 DNA 链，连接两个新形成的细胞。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/newly-discovered-mechanism-protects-dna-during-cell-division.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:24:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/newly-discovered-mechanism-protects-dna-during-cell-division</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的生存：我们正在进入经济奇点吗？ |卡勒姆·蔡斯</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/surviving-ai-are-we-entering-the-economic-singularity-calum-chace</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 05:09:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/surviving-ai-are-we-entering-the-economic-singularity-calum-chace</guid></item></channel></rss>